N: TS  1,  21
X: 21
%%Orig filename was JohnHardy-LuteSolo.abc
T: John Hardy (lute solo) [v.1 by Cranberry] (2:45)
N: "John Hardy" is a traditional American folk song based on the life of a coal worker in West Virginia.
N: The first known recording is by Eva Davis on Columbia Records in 1924.
N: LotRO adaptation by Cranberry of the Mighty Mighty Bree Tones, Landroval server.
M: 2/4
L: 1/16
Q:1/4=120
